            <h2>FAQ’s</h2>
            <h3>Q. What amenities are included on Carnival Cruise Line cruises? </h3>
            <p>Carnival Cruise Line amenities usually include accommodation, meals, onboard entertainment, pool access, open deck areas, and common relaxation spaces. These amenities are designed to provide a complete cruise experience without needing extra planning. </p>
            <h3>Q. Are meals included as part of Carnival Cruise Line amenities? </h3>
            <p>Yes, meals are included in the cruise fare. Travelers can enjoy multiple dining options onboard, with flexible meal times that allow them to eat according to their schedule rather than a strict routine. </p>
            <h3>Q. What types of rooms are available on Carnival Cruise Line? </h3>
            <p>Carnival Cruise Line offers different stateroom options such as interior rooms, ocean-view rooms, and balcony staterooms. This allows travelers to choose accommodations that fit their budget and comfort preferences. </p>
            <h3>Q. Does Carnival Cruise Line offer entertainment onboard? </h3>
            <p>Yes, onboard entertainment is a major part of Carnival Cruise Line amenities. Guests can enjoy live shows, music, comedy, and group activities. Participation is optional, so travelers can join in or relax as they prefer. </p>
            <h3>Q. Do Carnival Cruise Line amenities include pool and deck access? </h3>
            <p>Yes, Carnival Cruise Line ships offer pool areas and open deck spaces. These areas are popular for relaxing, enjoying fresh air, and spending time with family or friends during the cruise. </p>
